    {
      "id": "claim_d9c8d249f2c64d43926234144854c33a",
      "statement": "Control CTRL-PAY-040 prohibits any client-facing estimate of release time, likelihood of release, or next-steps timing for holds in tier G or tier R, and POL-FCC-014 §5.5(d) separately bars predictive/insight statements for payments in a tier G or R hold.",
