    },
    {
      "id": "claim_61dfc8c7cb13402fb67835d5eaa89de5",
      "statement": "Sanctions-related blocks or rejects are communicated to the client only by Sanctions Operations in writing per the Sanctions Operations Procedure (with OFAC reporting under 31 CFR 501.603/501.604); client-facing channels must not communicate screening outcomes themselves and show only the generic tier G/R presentation.",
