    {
      "id": "claim_5429efb187dd4522b21d14f220fdb0e1",
      "statement": "Control CTRL-PAY-031 (added following the FCT-1951 pilot) permits HRC-01 (DUP_SUSPECT) duplicate-suspect holds to be resolved via client digital attestation with step-up authentication, except that attestation for amounts above $5,000,000 still requires Wire Room release; the control applies to HRC-01 only and does not extend attestation-based resolution to any other HRC code.",
