    {
      "id": "claim_f83246bb3cda41bc83eb9c8d2c86e218",
      "statement": "Control CTRL-PAY-018 requires that HRC-02 (CALLBACK_REQUIRED) callback verification be completed out-of-band by phone to a contact on file obtained independently of the payment instruction or session; confirmations received through the channel that initiated the payment do not satisfy the control, though the channel may show that a callback is pending and let the client request one.",
