    {
      "id": "claim_a1fc0ad0dfaf4e34a140cbe4080d8245",
      "statement": "HMS currently exposes no generalized client-facing interface: GET /prsp/hms/v1/holds and POST /prsp/hms/v1/holds/{holdId}/disposition are restricted to the Investigations Workbench (and legacy PPH v1 sync) and gated by the HOLD_RELEASER role with maker-checker control CTRL-PAY-012; the proposed client-safe facade FCT-1893 (GET /prsp/hms/v1/holds/{holdId}/client-view returning only tier, copy key and permitted actions) was deprioritized in 2025-Q3 and does not exist, and no client attestation endpoint exists outside the HRC-01 pilot flow.",
